legend bottom
  |= Class |= Pattern |= Owner |= DDL authority |
  | core | cms_* | the image | image migrations only; the runner refuses |
  | plugin-system | cms_plugin_* | the image | image migrations only |
  | user | u_* | the tenant's admin | the DDL runner: typed AST, <=8 statements |
  | plugin | p_<id>_* | the plugin's declarations | the host migration executor only |
  |||||
  | **Loop contract** | cms_component_registry kind='list' carries exactly one [data-repeat] child and a clamp (C-4). kind='shell' is what cms_page.template resolves against (C-23). |
  | **Export class** | a p_<id>_* table's class comes from cms_plugin_installed.manifest_json.tables[].export; there is no fourth class (C-5). |
end legend
@enduml
